Input: 10 -> 20 -> 30 -> 40 -> 50
                    ^              |
                    |______________|
        (pos = 3, loop: 30->40->50->30)


STEP 1: DETECT LOOP

Initial: slow = 10, fast = 10

Iter 1: slow=20, fast=30
Iter 2: slow=30, fast=50
Iter 3: slow=40, fast=40 (50->30, 30->40) ← COLLISION at node 40!


STEP 2: COUNT LOOP NODES

curr = 40, count = 1

While (curr.next != 40):

Iter 1: curr.next=50 ≠ 40
        curr=50, count=2

Iter 2: curr.next=30 ≠ 40
        curr=30, count=3

Iter 3: curr.next=40 == 40 → Stop!


RESULT: count = 3 ✓

Loop: 30 -> 40 -> 50 -> 30 (3 nodes)


